  <section|Status><label|status>

  Draft, awaiting independent mathematical and source review. No Lean files
  were changed. Upstream source pin: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>
  (<verbatim|source/upstream.json>).

  Owned prose: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/annulus-recording-yield.tex>.

